# Monorepo Workflow

- This is a monorepo with multiple Go and JavaScript services.
- Identify the owning service before editing: `frontend/`, `indexer/`, `dong-service/`, `socket-service/`, or `prove-service/`.
- Prefer small, service-focused changes unless an API contract requires coordination.
- Do not assume a root-wide test or lint command exists.
- Run commands from the relevant service directory.

## Common Commands

- **All services**: `docker compose up --build`
- **Indexer**: `go build -o main .`, `go test ./... -v`, `golangci-lint run`, `gofmt -w .`
- **Frontend**: `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`
- **Dong service**: `make build`, `make run`, `make test`, `make swagger`, `golangci-lint run`
- **Socket service**: `go run main.go`, `go build ./...`, `go test ./... -v`

## Single-Test Pattern

For Go services:
```
go test ./path/to/package -run '^TestExactName$' -v
```
Keep regex anchored with `^` and `$` to avoid partial matches.

## Safety Rules

- Never commit secrets or credentials
- When backend responses change, update frontend types in the same task
- When schema changes in Go services, include migrations and verify models match
- Run linting before finishing any change
